# Introduce enable_on_device_model GN variable to control on-device ML model
# service integration at the content/ level. On QNX, both use_dawn=false and
# use_on_device_model_service=false make this default to false, automatically
# removing Dawn as an unwanted transitive dependency.
#
# Note: use_dawn is checked alongside enable_on_device_model in each BUILD.gn
# (not in features.gni declare_args) because GN declare_args evaluation order
# does not guarantee that use_dawn is available in all import contexts.
#
# See docs/qnx/fixes-and-decisions.md #50 (Dawn deferred on QNX).

